            "since": "0.1.0",
            "notes": "Two omissions at once. The parameters block is conditional on the tool having any, and strict is dropped because the reference builds the tool with a falsiness filter rather than a null filter — so a false strict never reaches the wire while a false store (trq-0016) does. That inconsistency is the reference's, and a port has to reproduce it rather than tidy it.",
