        {
            "id": "trq-0021",
            "title": "empty prompt string",
            "since": "0.1.0",
            "notes": "An empty string is not absent. Same reference defect as trq-0022 seen from the other side: the prompt path is gated on truthiness, so an empty prompt is dropped rather than sent as an empty turn. Kept as its own row because the two arguments fail for the same reason but a port could plausibly fix one and not the other.",
